### Login (get JWT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Register a sales officer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "officer1",
  "email": "officer1@crm.local",
  "password": "officer123",
  "role": "SALES_OFFICER"
}

### List customers (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crm/customers
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Confirm sales order (publishes sales.order.confirmed)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/sales-orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
